## Common Vulnerabilities

### SQL Injection

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const query = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${userId}`;

// ✅ GOOD
const query = 'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1';
await db.query(query, [userId]);
```

### XSS Prevention

```typescript
// ❌ BAD - Render raw HTML
dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: userInput }};

// ✅ GOOD - Escape output
<div>{userInput}</div>
```

### Command Injection

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
exec(`rm -rf ${userPath}`);

// ✅ GOOD - Validate and sanitize
if (!isValidPath(userPath)) throw new Error('Invalid path');
exec('rm -rf ' + sanitize(userPath));
```

